{"summary":"Rediscover your engineering creativity in this bridge building masterpiece.","description":"Poly Bridge 3 is a puzzle game where building bridges is key. Get vehicles to their destination by testing your engineering and problem solving skills. \n\nExplore the new Open World Campaign with a dozen worlds and 150+ new levels. Jumps, Hydraulics, ‘Normal’ Bridges, and more giving you hours of gameplay to enjoy! Take a flying leap in Vaulty Towers or flex those hydraulic muscles in Bifrost Bend!\n\nLet your engineering creativity flow with no restrictions in Sandbox mode, allowing you to push your bridge building skills to the limit.\n\nChallenge yourself with improving your rank on the Leaderboards and check out other player solutions in the Gallery!\n\nOur custom physics engine gives total control, reliability, and accuracy to your bridges. Sleep easy at night knowing your bridges will perform consistently every time!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/e5tSnAh3P14?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ubX5m8mGRLuDbTqjkiZXhhLi10G3cNVlRp1CNYqQkoUUvCUtyNHd1wj2ERxii7VQyjVXc8VElIfbi0CI2QOfxQ","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xm1FIKfQ2kzt9XNN-G5oZ_aahCZ8yYRb13_WsUtEKpenxvQpeSrJmfr4vcD62ld7ViTmxHL5h727BJlhrEHQvw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YN3QOc9vpvoXs_hBZIl1uxR8vTEUqoBnqLjKqUP7Q869lxuiRLaKNZgLz2tW7XHolg1TC8lXptrSZ6alpLVf","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qpWqGdotPLsxO3_98tO11ySmyq7TSV6E2A2S4UBmo2FGvVfLYzwMMgA_lJKuZUbaPZLafkfpXnw5rWpQKIJnsQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/07S6HFMPGMcNsPpOzEKpSPaWnxOlA_y38Q-ChEhqVCryZ8oOYhFM6UiyH9kZRY1b-Ufs0bpWLs2G_4NvAC7h","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/uUSXeLSW4xMTie7Oy1Y2xjAjUgXMNTWc21rPAkVohJWDALxj_QTdfVBf6MQEYSajZNPjlwqPfGPuHyL7UQxF7Q","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/MZszwCfbFIOJ5ufdFxuvcuK9WDOSi1ZjZGeaSFAzEKZoe5f2v1xNBKU9_NIWV8Ecm_yw136ILc2WR_Yl04JBIA","https://p